{"id":"657928","name":"腊肠排骨焖饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/657928/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"腊肠","amount":"适量"},{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香米","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/657928/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"生姜切片备用。","img":"images/657928/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"腊肠切薄片。","img":"images/657928/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片炒香。","img":"images/657928/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入排骨翻炒。","img":"images/657928/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"适量蚝油，老抽，生抽。","img":"images/657928/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色。","img":"images/657928/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/657928/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"排骨转至高压锅中小火压15分钟左右。","img":"images/657928/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大米用清水淘洗干净。","img":"images/657928/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"焖好的排骨把姜片捞出。","img":"images/657928/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"先将排骨汁倒入米中，量跟平时煮饭一样的刻度。","img":"images/657928/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"再把排骨铺在米上。","img":"images/657928/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加入适量盐。","img":"images/657928/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"电饭锅煮饭程序。","img":"images/657928/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"大米煮至水干。","img":"images/657928/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放入腊肠，继续把饭煮熟。","img":"images/657928/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"焖好的饭翻拌均匀，加上少许葱花即可。","img":"images/657928/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657928/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657928/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657928/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657928/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}